      "kind": "drawing",
      "url": "https://tilingsearch.mit.edu/HTML/data181/P105.html",
      "note": "Read from his finished drawing, not construction instructions. Mahmood Maher al-Naqsh, Design and execution of drawing in Iranian tilework, Islamic period (Reza Abbasi Museum, 1983), volume 5, page 105, Atiq courtyard, Qom, Iran. Wichmann says the colours follow the original mosaic presentation."
